with a full smile. Usually dressed in a cropped bottle-green coat with a knotted piece of sail thread on a key ring, Keir looks down for a moment before saying something difficult when listening.","personality":"Keir can be lavish with time and quite careful with cash. A free afternoon is sometimes the biggest gift Keir can afford to give, and family knows to take it seriously.","agenda":"To cover an evening wash shift to undo the damage.","family":"Lena Osborne is Keir’s half-sibling. Keir chooses whether they walk home or sit a while. Lena brings a spare shopping bag. That small arrangement gives both a reason to see each other on weeks when asking for company outright feels difficult. Asked about *The upstairs piano*, Lena says, “I bought it so my son would come home to practice.”","connections":"Rae Vargas. The repair shift is ordered by the bus schedule the pupils worked out for the iron. Also in the story is Dale Valdez (school contact).","familyIds":["AH-R0381"],"connectionIds":["AH-R0909","AH-R0910"],"reactions":[{"situation":"A donor asks to photograph the children receiving clothes","response":"Keir asks the children and families whether they want to appear in the picture.","asWritten":"A donor asks to photograph the children receiving clothes. Keir asks the children and families whether they want to appear in the picture."},{"situation":"An envelope of wages is found under a café chair","response":"Keir brings the envelope to the counter unopened and stays long enough to make a note of who accepted it.","asWritten":"An envelope of wages is found under a café chair. Keir brings the envelope to the counter unopened and stays long enough to make a note of who accepted it."},{"situation":"If invited to an expensive outing","response":"Keir suggests meeting afterward and explains why without asking the others to abandon their plans.","asWritten":"If invited to an expensive outing, Keir suggests meeting afterward and explains why without asking the others to abandon their plans."}]},"appearanceSource":"biography casting design"}},{"mesh":6,"name":"Hair_afro01","skin":0},{"mesh":7,"name":"Cloth_trenchcoat","skin":0},{"mesh":8,"name":"Cloth_tshirt","skin":0},{"mesh":9,"name":"Cloth_jeans","skin":0},{"mesh":10,"name":"Cloth_boots","skin":0}],"meshes":[{"name":"base","extras":{"targetNames":["weight_min","muscle_max","height_short","face_nose_width_decr","face_nose_length_incr","face_nose_height_decr","face_jaw_width_incr","face_chin_incr","face_cheekbones_incr","face_eye_size_incr","face_eye_spacing_incr","face_eye_tilt_decr","face_lips_incr","face_mouth_width_decr","face_ear_size_incr","face_forehead_incr","blink_left","blink_right","corr_weight_min__muscle_max"]},"weights":[0.6271,0.0252,0.0279,0.0267,0.2209,0.4072,0.2842,0.1412,0.4895,0.0844,0.303,0.3356,0.5321,0.4752,0.2329,0.3888,0,0,0.0158],"primitives":[{"attributes":{"POSITION":2,"NORMAL":3,"TEXCOORD_0":4,"JOINTS_0":5,"WEIGHTS_0":6},"indices":1,"material":0,"targets":[{"POSITION":7,"NORMAL":8},{"POSITION":9,"NORMAL":10},{"POSITION":11,"NORMAL":12},{"POSITION":13,"NORMAL":14},{"POSITION":15,"NORMAL":16},{"POSITION":17,"NORMAL":18},{"POSITION":19,"NORMAL":20},{"POSITION":21,"NORMAL":22},{"POSITION":23,"NORMAL":24},{"POSITION":25,"NORMAL":26},{"POSITION":27,"NORMAL":28},{"POSITION":29,"NORMAL":30},{"POSITION":31,"NORMAL":32},{"POSITION":33,"NORMAL":34},{"POSITION":35,"NORMAL":36},{"POSITION":37,"NORMAL":38},{"POSITION":39,"NORMAL":40},{"POSITION":41,"NORMAL":42},{"POSITION":43,"NORMAL":44}]}]},{"name":"Eyebrows","extras":{"targetNames":["weight_min","muscle_max","height_short","face_nose_width_decr","face_nose_length_incr","face_nose_height_decr","face_jaw_width_incr","face_chin_incr","face_cheekbones_incr","face_eye_size_incr","face_eye_spacing_incr","face_eye_tilt_decr","face_lips_incr","face_mouth_width_decr","face_ear_size_incr","face_forehead_incr","blink_left","blink_right","corr_weight_min__muscle_max"]},"weights":[0.6271,0.0252,0.0279,0.0267,0.2209,0.4072,0.2842